{"reviews":[{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-0","r":4.0,"t":"Long wand applicators??? WOW!","x":"These are a godsend! I don't know why these aren't in beauty stores. Brushes never give the dense application I get from a good foam applicator, yet the disposable ones sold in beauty stores are literally like 2&#34; and hard to maneuver. The long length of these disposable applicators are a dream for the beauty guru. Whereas brushes are also itchy on a sensitive lid and dump eye shadow products sprinkles all over cheeks, these keep product on the applicator allowing direct transfer to eyelid. A","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-1","r":5.0,"t":"These are great for applying eyeshadow heavy or light","x":"These are great for applying eyeshadow heavy or light, and you can get in tighter than with a brush.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-2","r":5.0,"t":"The best part of the sponge is that it is disposable","x":"I purchased this product to smooth makeup application around the eyes and nose.  The best part of the sponge is that it is disposable.  I used to wash a small brush everyday for this use but this became tedious and time consuming.  Q-tips have a tendency to take away the full layer of application and so the disposable sponge has worked perfectly.  One wand will last 2 - 3 days.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-3","r":5.0,"t":"The best part of the sponge is that it is disposable","x":"I purchased this product to smooth makeup application around the eyes and nose.  The best part of the sponge is that it is disposable.  I used to wash a small brush everyday for this use but this became tedious and time consuming.  Q-tips have a tendency to take away the full layer of application and so the disposable sponge has worked perfectly.  One wand will last 2 - 3 days.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-4","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"Some of the ends spin freely, making it difficult to get precise control.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-5","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"Not as stiff and sturdy as I would've liked.  Pretty flimsy but they work.  Wouldn't buy these again.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-6","r":5.0,"t":"Handy Dandy","x":"This product is great for applying high-lighter in corner of eye.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-7","r":5.0,"t":"Seem to work well","x":"I just received these foam eye shadow brushes today. I received exactly 50. They seem nice and sturdy. The one I tried out picked up the eye shadow color well, and also worked very nicely for blending.  I chose them for the longer handles, which are easier for me to use than short ones. The foam heads seem to be attached well and I'm trusting will hold up to cleaning, as I hope to be able to get multiple uses out of these (I don't want to be throwing away lots of plastic). If they do hold up the","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-8","r":5.0,"t":"Seem to work well","x":"I just received these foam eye shadow brushes today. I received exactly 50. They seem nice and sturdy. The one I tried out picked up the eye shadow color well, and also worked very nicely for blending.  I chose them for the longer handles, which are easier for me to use than short ones. The foam heads seem to be attached well and I'm trusting will hold up to cleaning, as I hope to be able to get multiple uses out of these (I don't want to be throwing away lots of plastic). If they do hold up the","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-9","r":4.0,"t":"Good price for the amount you get.","x":"They do the job. Not much flexibility, but I didn\u2019t really think there would be. Price is great compared to paying way more & getting much fewer in a store.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-10","r":4.0,"t":"50! Eyeshadow applicators!","x":"What isn't to like about loads of eye makeup applicators! Lots of them and I love that they are two-sided with room for your hand to hold them.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great for makeup events (or when you are making a ...","x":"Hold up under use, stays together and does not fall apart.  Great for makeup events (or when you are making a call to do a bridal party) or for when you just want to keep your own makeup as germ free as possible","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-12","r":4.0,"t":"Was looking for something disposable to use on vacation and ...","x":"Was looking for something disposable to use on vacation and found these. I was suppressed how flexible the sponges were and the makeup goes one smooth.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-13","r":5.0,"t":"These applicators are long enough to hold on to!","x":"The size is great. I hate the short applicator brushes that come with eye shadow. These are long enough to hold on to!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great tools to have","x":"Love these for many, many uses.. I don't like using qtips to clean up makeup smudges or smooth out because they leave fuzz behind. These are great, reasonable, and like that they are long handled and not rough.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-15","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful!!!","x":"Theses are GREAT. I was looking for a finely tapered tip. This product is exactly what I was looking for. I also like the longer length of the applicator.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-16","r":5.0,"t":"Absolutely love them. They are soft and you can reuse.","x":"These are good quality made applicators. I love them. You can reuse them or not. There are so many. These will last a long time.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-17","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"glad to have the longer version of the applicators! colors go on smooth and the sponges aren't brittle","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-18","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love these, use them to put on eye shadow and touch up eyeliner.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-19","r":5.0,"t":"More than expected!","x":"Have not been able to find these locally ANYWHERE!  Only short ones that were difficult for my arthritic hands to hold.  These are phenomenal and such a good buy!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-20","r":2.0,"t":"Not spongey or fluffy","x":"I was looking for more of a spongey tip and these are not. They just smear your eye shadow around instead of absorbing it and patting it where you apply.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-21","r":5.0,"t":"Hobby and crafts must have","x":"I use these for applying paper sealer on small graphics that will be coated with epoxy resin. Work like a charm and last  a long time.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-22","r":1.0,"t":"Does not apply well at all!  Bring back the original applicators please!","x":"There is way too much plastic in the material to absorb shadow, let alone apply evenly. I was very disappointed in this item.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-23","r":5.0,"t":"Love love these","x":"These are amazing I love them. They don\u2019t fall apart and are very soft when applied to the skin. I will always buy these \ud83d\udc9c\ud83d\udc9c\ud83d\udc9c","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B06XHJ743Q-24","r":4.0,"t":"Very soft, not scratchy","x":"What kept me from giving these 5 stars is that I would like them to be a bit larger. Other than that....they are great!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the long handles, saying they are easier to hold and maneuver than short applicators.","cites":[1,8,9,11,14,15]},{"text":"Many customers find the foam applicators great for applying and blending eyeshadow, including precise work around the eyes and nose.","cites":[2,3,4,7,8,9,13]},{"text":"The disposable nature and large quantity (50 per pack) are commonly appreciated, especially for hygiene and convenience.","cites":[3,4,8,9,10,11,12,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain that the applicators are flimsy or not sturdy, with ends that spin freely and reduce control.","cites":[5,6]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the sponges are not very flexible, though this was expected by some.","cites":[10,13]}]},"qa":[]}